# Retired git directory kept as a safety copy during the repository rebuild.
# MUST be ignored: it is a full 7.5 GB repository sitting inside the working tree,
# and `git add -A` will otherwise try to commit all of it.
_git-old/
_git-dead/

.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
DADAFilteredSeqs/
SilvaDB/

# LaTeX build leftovers from knitting Rmd to PDF (.html and .md outputs are kept)
Analysis/**/*.tex
Analysis/**/*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large files. Nothing in this repository should carry sequence data, reference
# genomes or aligner indices. The RNAseq read set alone is 41 GB (68 single-end
# FASTQs) and the PMEA_v1 reference is 347 Mb; both live outside the repo, in
# BIOcean5D/Data_Sequences and in scratch respectively.
#
# If a large derived file ever genuinely has to be versioned, track it with
# git LFS rather than committing it directly:
#     git lfs install
#     git lfs track "Data/07-AAC-RNAseq/*.rds"
#     git add .gitattributes
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.fastq
*.fastq.gz
*.fq
*.fq.gz

# Superseded step-01 inputs: the 44 environmental/control FASTQs that had been
# trimmed one cutadapt pass short of the corals (221 bp, retaining the terminal
# TAA of 515F), replaced 2026-10-27 by their .fwd equivalents from
# BIOcean5D/Data_Sequences/True_Sequences_16S/HostRemoved. Kept locally only so
# the pre-repair ASV table can be reproduced; safe to delete.
Data/00-AAC-Sequences/_mistrimmed_superseded/
*.bam
*.sam
*.cram
*.bai
*.fna
*.gff
*.gff3
*.gtf
salmon_index/
Data/07-AAC-RNAseq/ref/
Data/07-AAC-RNAseq/**/*.fastp.json
Data/07-AAC-RNAseq/**/*.fastp.html

# Regenerable step-01/03 intermediates and MaAsLin2 output. These are rebuilt by a
# re-knit, so keeping them out of history avoids committing successive copies
# (dadaF.ASV.rds is 37.6 MB and FastTree.log 17.2 MB per version).
Data/01-AAC-AssignSeqVariants/DADA2-Results/01-AAC-AssignSeqVariants_dadaF.ASV.rds
Data/03-AAC-PhylogeneticTree/FastTree.log
maaslin2_output_directory/
Data/03-AAC-PhylogeneticTree/03-AAC-PhylogeneticTree_DECIPHER_aligned_PhyseqASVs.fasta
